    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Young’s Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 18 Railway Cottages, a distinctive three-bedroom home superbly positioned just off Serpentine Avenue in the heart of Dublin 4.\r\n\r\nArranged over three levels, the property offers approximately 183 sq.m. (1,970 sq.ft.) of well-proportioned accommodation, combining generous living space with excellent separation between the bedroom and reception areas.\r\n\r\nThe entrance level is centred around a spacious open-plan lounge and dining room, with a separate kitchen and guest WC. The lower level provides two generous double bedrooms, two bathrooms and a useful utility room. Occupying the entire upper floor is the impressive principal bedroom suite, complete with a generous en-suite bathroom.\r\n\r\nA particularly appealing feature of No. 18 is its private south-facing garden to the front of the property, providing a wonderful outdoor space for dining, entertaining and relaxing. Private parking is also located to the front, adding to the property's convenience.\r\n\r\nThe location is exceptional. Sandymount Village and Ballsbridge are both within approximately a 10-minute walk, while Sandymount and Lansdowne Road DART stations are also close by. The seafront promenade, Grand Canal Dock, the RDS, Aviva Stadium and Dublin city centre are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThe property is ideally located for some of Dublin's most highly regarded schools, including St Michael's College, Muckross Park College, The Teresian School, Gonzaga College and Blackrock College.\r\n\r\nNo. 18 Railway Cottages offers a rare combination of generous accommodation, private outdoor space, parking and an outstanding Dublin 4 address.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
